Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.97,0:00:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will only have few gates in Distyr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.95,0:00:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Siyune!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, do you know what happened to Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been three days and\Nshe hasn't logged back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.37,0:00:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of us have been able\Nto contact her either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.21,0:00:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, I hate to say this, but I don't\Nthink she wants to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.37,0:00:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she's doing it for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.57,0:00:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling something wasn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.23,0:01:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could tell everyone in the group\Nwas avoiding getting too close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.35,0:01:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing I want is to\Nupset anyone, or be a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.81,0:01:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, I don't see how any\Nof this could be for my sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.67,0:01:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not a nuisance!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me when I say we're all\Ntruly happy to have met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got to have one last amazing\Nmemory of our time together here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.81,0:01:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Yuki, I know she's grateful too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.71,0:01:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please, forget you ever met us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really is the best\Nthing for you and for Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't ever see any of you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.35,0:01:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought after the guild was gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.93,0:01:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we could at least\Nkeep on being friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.59,0:01:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this whole time, I was\Nthe only one who thought that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.05,0:01:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.09,0:02:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
