Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.15,0:04:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morning, Asuna! Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we finally caught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.05,0:04:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you gotta tell us what\Nthat message was about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.37,0:04:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I said something\Nabout you joining a guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.09,0:04:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on, tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.55,0:04:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.87,0:04:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.93,0:04:31.81,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fscx161\fscy161\frz-9.01\c&H9E9996&\pos(1227,405)\fax-0.25}K{*\c&HA4A09E&}i{*\c&HABA7A6&}r{*\c&HB1AFAD&}i{*\c&HB8B6B5&}g{\c&HBEBDBD&}a{*\c&HB5B4B4&}y{*\c&HADACAB&}a {*\c&H9C9B98&}K{\c&H93928F&}a{*\c&HA4A2A0&}z{\c&HB4B2B1&}u{*\c&HACAAA9&}t{\c&HA4A3A1&}o
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, how's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you see my face okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you, but you're a little blurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.55,0:04:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it's the autofocus again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.71,0:04:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got to be that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.25,0:04:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a sec, Yui. Okay, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This second, you still want to see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.11,0:05:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after they say it's better\Nyou didn't, you still do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want is to talk\Nto Yuki one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.81,0:05:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't leave it like this. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.29,0:05:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I might have found where she's at.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.17,0:05:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but it's the best I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.51,0:05:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think she'd be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That place has a medicuboid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the only ones doing\Nthe clinical trials for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.00,0:05:41.21,Address,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\frz-16.26\pos(355.5,391.5)\fax-0.31}hama Port, Northern G
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.00,0:05:41.21,Address,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\frz-9.32\pos(930,522)\fax-0.31\k0}eneral Hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.43,0:05:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Medicuboid?
