Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.51,0:05:54.93,Reservations,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fscy140\pos(132,976.5)}Reservations
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.73,0:05:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. May I help you? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.95,0:05:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, um, I think I'm looking for a patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.43,0:06:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she's about 15 years old or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.11,0:06:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think her name might be\NYuki, but I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a name, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, well, I think she might be the\Npatient who's testing that Medicuboid thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.99,0:06:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.47,0:06:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Asuna Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.39,0:06:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get someone right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.17,0:06:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.43,0:06:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.59,0:06:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you haven't been waiting long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not at all. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.07,0:06:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They told me you're Asuna Yuki?\NYes. Great. I'm Dr. Kurohashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.79,0:06:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Yuki Kono's primary physician.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.75,0:06:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki Kono.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.95,0:06:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm surprised\Nyou even found us. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, we keep a\Nlow profile. That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki warned me someone called Asuna might\Ntry and pay her a visit at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:06:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She warned you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.65,0:07:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.56,0:07:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She also said she didn't\Ntell you where she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I said, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not going to find you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When reception told me you were\Nin the lobby, I was shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.11,0:07:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, has Yuki told you anything\Nelse about me or how we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.13,0:07:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say she has.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pretty much the only\Nperson she talks about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although it seems whenever Yuki does\Nmention you, she always ends up in tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.19,0:07:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's always been a brave girl\Nand never felt sorry for herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wants to see you, but she\Ncan't bring herself to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.25,0:07:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know, and I still\Ncan't wrap my head around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.35,0:07:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A friend of hers told me in-game\Nthat it was for my own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.47,0:07:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.77,0:07:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't we see each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For starters, I should tell you what the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:08:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,medicuboid is about okay medicuboid is the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.45,0:08:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,code name for the World's first medical\Nfull dive machine it's so revolutionary the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.45,0:08:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,government's backing its Development it's\Na full dive rig for hospitals uh-huh for
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,example let's say you're a patient With a\Nvisual or hearing disability this machine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can give you back those senses you know\Nhow with The atmosphere rig images and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sounds get sent directly\Nto your brain well
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.93,0:08:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Transmitting signals.\NIsn't all it does, the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,atmosphere has the ability to cancel out
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,physical sensations too\Nback here It hits that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.89,0:08:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spot with electromagnetic pulses so it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.99,0:08:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,temporarily numbs the\Nnerves it's kind of like
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.43,0:08:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,general anesthetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but how is that\Nuseful for hospitals?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a limit to how much\Nthe Amusphere can block out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens if a patient's in serious
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.99,0:08:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pain? Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hit the nail right on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The atmosphere can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.95,0:08:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:09:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the nerve gear can't block pain\Nfrom surgery or chronic illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.69,0:09:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the medicuboid enhances\Nthe electromagnetic pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, it's built into the\Nbed so there's more coverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.27,0:09:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The brain, spine, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.19,0:09:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once it gets on the market, it'll change\Nthe course of medicine as we know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.23,0:09:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The medicuboid has incredible potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.89,0:09:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could, say, pair it with the\Ncamera and give it an AR function.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The patient gets real-world\Nimages in real time. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds more like a miracle\Nthan a machine to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.37,0:09:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.35,0:09:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a way, it is a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, curing illness\Nis something it can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.01,0:09:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Medicuboid is making\Nan impact, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.69,0:09:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In terminal care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terminal care?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.59,0:09:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.55,0:09:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's helping patients who are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.95,0:09:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.99,0:09:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki told me that if you really wanted\Nto hear about what's going on with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.55,0:09:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could go ahead and tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.57,0:10:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have to warn you,\Nit's not a pleasant story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.07,0:10:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to wish this\Nconversation ended right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.67,0:10:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to hear it. The whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm not leaving\Nhere until you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.87,0:10:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki was born in May 2011.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.69,0:10:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there were complications, and the\Ndoctors had to give her mother a C-section.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her mother was given a\Ntransfusion during the procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately, the blood they\Nused was contaminated with a virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.53,0:10:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't find out\Nabout it until September,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when her mother was having tests\Nrun for an infection she got.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.19,0:10:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But by that time, the whole\Nfamily'd been infected.
