Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.05,0:11:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to keep the room on the other\Nside of the glass, hermetically sealed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.67,0:11:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so this is as close as you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.85,0:11:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.59,0:11:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, what kind of\Nillness does Yuki have?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acquired Immune Deficiency Syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AIDS for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's caused by the HIV\Nvirus. It's scary but
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's hope because\Nnot everyone who has it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.13,0:11:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,develops aids if you can\Ntreat hiv early you can
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have a long life in her\Nfamily's case the virus
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was difficult to treat\Nit's a drug resistant
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.45,0:11:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strain when her mother\Nfound out she got so upset
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.01,0:11:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over her children's fate\Nshe actually considered
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.77,0:12:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killing the whole family\Nalong with herself
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.57,0:12:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then she changed her\Nmind and decided to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the disease instead she\Nfought it for her kids
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yes soon after they were diagnosed\Nyuki was put on a multi-drug
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,course of therapy but it's hard\Nfor a child to have to take so many
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,different medications and keep\Ntaking them the side effects are one
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing the other being shunned by\Npeople who don't understand her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.35,0:12:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, Yuki was a trooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She believed her and her family\Nwould get better eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.55,0:12:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, when she was in the fourth grade,\Nher immune system suddenly collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.63,0:12:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.61,0:12:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she was brought to this hospital, and\Nthat's when she was diagnosed with AIDS.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But like I said, she's a trooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She never once lost her optimism.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.23,0:12:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:12:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.06,0:12:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is she using the medicuboid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.97,0:13:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you could say\Nit all started back when
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.99,0:13:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone was panicking over\Nthat nerve gear incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They had just completed the first
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prototype of the medicuboid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.31,0:13:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The electromagnetic pulses it put out were\Nmany times stronger than the nerve gears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a problem, since no one knew what\Nthe long-term effects of exposure were.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.23,0:13:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of that, they couldn't find\Na patient willing to take the risk,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so its trial run was stalled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.29,0:13:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I found out, I thought about Yuki's\Nsituation, and I contacted her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.29,0:13:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she were the test subject, she'd be\Nmoved to the medicuboid sterile room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.63,0:13:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'd run less of a risk\Nof getting an infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told them it was a great opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.43,0:13:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least that's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.31,0:13:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But honestly, I still don't know\Nif I was right to suggest it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.27,0:13:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God knows what it was like\Nfor Yuki and her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.99,0:13:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thinking about whether or not to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.93,0:13:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think the lure of the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.35,0:13:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The virtual world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.81,0:13:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was the deciding factor for Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:14:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that brave little girl\Nagreed to be a test subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.35,0:14:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they moved her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.33,0:14:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's lived inside the Medicuboid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.27,0:14:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.41,0:14:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean she's never come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.31,0:14:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, she hasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.09,0:14:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki stays logged in and rarely\Nspends any time in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.43,0:14:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's always in a lot of pain, but thanks\Nto the Medicuboid Sensation Canceller,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.87,0:14:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she can block it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.91,0:14:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So wait, you mean she's\Nin a continuous Hero dive?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.69,0:14:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For three years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a whole year longer than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.35,0:14:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It felt like they were a product of\Nthe full-dive environment itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.65,0:14:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.77,0:14:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I got to see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.93,0:15:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be okay as long\Nas she's here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're doing everything we can for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even if the room is sterile,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.77,0:15:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no way to eliminate\Nthe virus that's inside her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.67,0:15:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.45,0:15:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki doesn't have much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's most likely the reason why she
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tried cutting ties with\Nyou the way she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.07,0:15:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why she...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.79,0:15:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.89,0:15:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering, does\NYuuki have an older sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.01,0:15:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.61,0:15:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A twin sister, to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name's Aiko, and she was\Nborn a few minutes earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki was the cheerful one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.41,0:15:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, Aiko would just sit\Nand watch her, and smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.79,0:15:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, if Aiko were here,\NI'd imagine she'd be a lot like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.73,0:16:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.95,0:16:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki's parents passed away two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And last year, Aiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.27,0:16:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.03,0:16:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki! Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.75,0:16:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.99,0:16:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.23,0:16:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look exactly like you do in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.53,0:16:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.33,0:16:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just... I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.31,0:16:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.33,0:16:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it be okay if Asuna\Nused the room next door?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.65,0:16:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep an atmosphere in\Nthere so I can visit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.49,0:16:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, it's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.07,0:16:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ALO app's on the startup menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.31,0:17:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you log in, come to the\Nplace where we first met, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.57,0:17:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.87,0:17:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see you one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.13,0:17:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this time I want to\Ntalk to you for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.27,0:17:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.11,0:18:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.07,0:18:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you did it, but I had a\Nfeeling you'd find me in the real world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.55,0:18:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I was so careful not to say\Nnothing, thought I had you fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.13,0:18:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't work, you found me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must be turned and psychic, cause\Nmy predictions never come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.09,0:18:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm happy, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.03,0:18:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sis used to hug me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You smell like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.79,0:18:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I go play Fairy\NMemos with you two? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.11,0:19:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, she was the first leader\Nthe Sleeping Knights ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you thought I was strong,\Nman, you should have seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.91,0:19:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We met Siyunay and the other guys in this\Nvirtual hospice called the Serene Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back then, there were nine of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.57,0:19:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my sister, Clovis, and Merida...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they're all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.19,0:19:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, if you want to\Nknow why we're disbanding?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.71,0:19:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cause we promised each other\Nif we lost someone, we'd end it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.55,0:19:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I couldn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.97,0:19:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sleeping knights won't be\Naround anymore by this spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's not cause we'll all\Nbe too busy to play anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.59,0:19:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cause a little while ago, two\Nof us got the news from our doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They gave us three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that's why we were all so\Nfired up on having one last big
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.17,0:20:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,adventure together in this world we\Nwanted to leave some kind of proof we
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.31,0:20:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were here on that big old monument\Nwhere everyone can see it one last
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,run that was so cool we could brag\Nabout it to my sis and the others
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.31,0:20:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but nothing was going right for\Nus so we decided the best way to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get there was to get someone tough\Nenough to help but we just caused
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.15,0:20:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you trouble and we hurt your\Nfeelings too i'm sorry we all are
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.93,0:20:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forget about us it's probably for
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.01,0:20:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the best anyway i can't do that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.89,0:20:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm happy i got to meet you all of you and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.41,0:20:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm glad i got to be a\Npart of your last quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.37,0:20:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after everything, I still\Nwish I could join the Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.69,0:20:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wish, I wish you could too, but\NI'm happy I came here and got to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.87,0:20:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saying that makes it\Nworth it, more than worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.93,0:20:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough for me. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.41,0:21:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But isn't there anything\Nelse you want to do? I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.71,0:21:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's lots of places\Nin all time you haven't been yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.85,0:21:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And other virtual worlds,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.59,0:21:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still lots of things\Nto do and places to see,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't tell me you've had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the last three years, We got to go\Non tons of adventures in other worlds,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.77,0:21:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I want my very last memory To be\Nthe one I got to go on with you, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but can't you think of anything\Nelse you want to see? Or maybe do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.37,0:21:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.01,0:21:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess maybe go to school again for\Nreal, no forget it, just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.41,0:21:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy you want to help but don't sweat
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.71,0:21:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it it's cool I had an awesome life really!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.61,0:22:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can wait what maybe\Nyou can go you know to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.09,0:22:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.46,0:22:30.34,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k21}Ma{\k20}chi {\k40}a{\k24}ka{\k57}ri {\k27}te{\k28}ra{\k30}shi{\k100}ta {\k19}ni{\k21}gi{\k20}ya{\k22}ka {\k21}na {\k45}wa{\k25}ra{\k32}i {\k27}go{\k23}e {\k83}to
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.46,0:22:30.34,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The street lights cast a glow on cheerful laughter
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.34,0:22:34.93,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k51\fad(200,200)}Ro{\k44}ji{\k41}u{\k25}ra {\k39}no {\k49}a{\k52}shi{\k23}a{\k138}to
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.34,0:22:34.93,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And footprints in the back-alley
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.27,0:22:38.39,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k30\fad(200,200)}Tsu{\k26}ta{\k18}e {\k27}ta{\k34}i {\k23}o{\k39}mo{\k21}i {\k93}wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.27,0:22:38.39,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I wonder how much you understood of the feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.25,0:22:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know how much I can tell you?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.39,0:22:41.52,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k29\fad(200,200)}Do{\k20}re {\k19}da{\k20}ke {\k22}to{\k41}do{\k22}i {\k59}tan {\k24}da{\k59}rou
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.39,0:22:41.52,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I've always wanted to convey to you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.13,0:22:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always feel like I can tell you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.52,0:22:47.40,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k39\fad(200,200)}I{\k28}tsu{\k30}mo {\k28}fu{\k43}ri {\k25}mu{\k32}i{\k21}te {\k46}ta{\k40}shi{\k38}ka{\k46}me{\k168}ru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.52,0:22:47.40,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I always turn around to you and make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.79,0:22:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.78,0:22:52.16,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k15\fad(200,200)}I{\k27}tsu {\k37}da{\k38}tte {\k26}ma{\k22}yo{\k19}wa{\k54}zu
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.78,0:22:52.16,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Because no matter how I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.87,0:22:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.16,0:23:02.33,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k28\fad(200,200)}Ki{\k18}mi {\k38}wa {\k43}ki{\k43}tto {\k63}don{\k19}na {\k20}bo{\k21}ku {\k26}mo {\k54}oi{\k61}ka{\k64}ke{\k161}te {\k27}ku{\k14}re{\k65}ru {\k61}ka{\k192}ra
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.16,0:23:02.33,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I believe you'd always chase after me without any hesitation
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.45,0:22:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.87,0:23:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you. I am
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.96,0:23:15.47,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k35\fad(200,200)}Ji{\k23}tto {\k18}mi{\k22}tsu{\k21}me{\k81}ta {\k80}ki{\k84}mi {\k74}no {\k112}hi{\k22}to{\k24}mi {\k97}ni {\k16}u{\k44}tsu{\k23}tta {\k38}bo{\k26}ku {\k56}ga {\k22}i{\k61}ki{\k17}ta {\k42}shi{\k21}ru{\k191}shi
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.96,0:23:15.47,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}When I gazed at your eyes, I saw the proof that I've lived
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.43,0:23:22.48,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k29\fad(200,200)}Na{\k15}n{\k21}do {\k20}mo {\k82}to{\k82}gi{\k74}re {\k90}sou{\k102}na {\k23}ko{\k26}do{\k38}u
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.43,0:23:22.48,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Whenever my heartbeat was about to stop,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.48,0:23:26.65,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k60\fad(200,200)}Tsu{\k22}yo{\k37}ku {\k22}tsu{\k40}yo{\k21}ku {\k41}na{\k16}ra{\k27}shi{\k130}ta
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.48,0:23:26.65,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You made it ring out very, very loudly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.94,0:23:34.99,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k23\fad(200,0)}Kyou {\k56}wo {\k38}ko{\k25}e{\k87}te {\k40}mi{\k24}ta{\k36}in{\k396}da
